    ],
    "text": "For problem 4, technology that would hinder EVs\u2019spread include: car-share, ride-share services and hyperloop. While technology that would boost EVs\u2019spreadinclude: self-driving cars, rapid battery-swap stations for electric cars, and flying cars"
